      "paperId": "61a3081eadd33418a1159b3778b0c544e0f50392",
      "title": "An introduction to Gy\u00f6rgy M\u00e1rkus\u2019s aesthetics: Transformation from praxis aesthetics to theory of aesthetic modernity",
      "authors": [
